OL,3,GNEWSABags wait goes on after air
OL,4,Atraffic control chaos
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger who had to abandon her
OL,7,Fholiday due to an air traffic control
OL,8,Ftechnical issue says she has still not
OL,9,Fhad her baggage returned a week later.
OL,11,FHelen Moore from Ottershaw, Surrey,
OL,12,Fabandoned her holiday to Corfu after a
OL,13,Fnine-hour wait at Heathrow Airport when
OL,14,Fher flight was caught up in widespread
OL,15,Fcancellations earlier in September.
OL,17,FShe told BBC Radio Surrey that British
OL,18,FAirways had not returned her luggage
OL,19,Fand she had received "really no good
OL,20,Finformation at all" until Monday.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
