OL,3,GNEWSABags wait goes on after air
OL,4,Atraffic control chaos
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish Airways said last Wednesday it
OL,7,Fwas "incredibly sorry" for the
OL,8,Fexperience customers endured "because
OL,9,Fof an issue that has been entirely out
OL,10,Fof our control".
